### Get all projects (requires token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/project
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create project (requires token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/project
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Test Project",
  "description": "Ett testprojekt"
}

